<title>JAPAN: Tec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		104.93		vs	   96.58</p>
<p> Operating     prft 1.15		vs     loss 1.37</p>
<p> Current	  prft 376 million    vs     loss 1.26</p>
<p> Net		prft 325 million    vs     loss 1.41</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 1.21 yen	  vs     loss 5.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    268 million	  vs	 268 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tec Corp is a manufacturer of retailer-use equipment, including point of sale systems and electronic cash registers.</p>
